      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Divergence safety net",
      "items": [
        "Skip happens before backward \u2014 bad batches never touch parameters",
        "Restore covers weights, optimizers, scheduler, opt_steps; sampler state is not saved"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Clocks and resume limits",
      "items": [
        "global_step counts micro-batches; the scheduler advances per optimizer step (\u00f74)",
        "MTP loss is silently disabled: main() reads mtp_loss_weight from training:, but the YAML defines it under model:"
